# Today is Monday 23 Nov 2026. Each scenario is followed by an expect: block (3 roles x 3 moods, max 3 picks each).
# Source has 297 scenarios (ids 248, 249, 250 are absent in the input); numbering is kept as given.
# Date assumptions: in 3 days = Thu 26 Nov; next monday = Mon 30 Nov; 15 tarikh = 15 Dec.
# Tasks marked "after X" are blocked until X is done; blocked tasks are never picked.

